{"sba-keyaki-19378":{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" \n こんばんわん🐶\n \n \n \n 今日も1日お疲れ様です!\n \n \n 朝は雪がチラホラ\n まだまだ寒いですね。。。。\n \n \n 寒い中、舞台ザンビを観に来てくださった皆様ありがとうございました🙇‍♀️\n \n 今日で3公演目!\n 早い事にもう折り返し地点です💦\n \n 舞台って本当に毎回その場に立ってて感じるこやその日1番心に残った場面が違くてとても不思議な感じです。\n でもそれがとても新鮮で今すごく貴重な経験をさせて頂いてるんだなぁ…と今ブログを書きながら思ってます。(_ _).｡o○\n \n 目標を高く持って千秋楽まで頑張っていきます!\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n 日向坂46\n \n すごく可愛い。日向坂46は世界中の曇り空を綺麗な青空にしてくれそう。\n \n \n 欅坂46、日向坂46\n これからもよろしくお願いします!\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYNGEHHPFHZA3G4S6QSW1V3","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYNGFGG0SXEJ52Y7NK57YNV","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n 左目ウィンクちょっと上達しました😌\n \n \n \n \n \n \n 石森虹花🌈🌼"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-2792":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ケーキの写メ(*´д｀*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/minami.hoshino/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/02/10/dsc_0156.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おいしそーでしょ??"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーに「このケーキみなみっぽーい♪」って言われたー(*^_^*)うーん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんなにおっきいいちごのタルト初めて食べたー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/minami.hoshino/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/02/10/20120201131848.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうそう(｀・ω・´)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなみは乃木坂に入ったときから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずーっと血液型不明になってたの!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってことで、なんとみなみ血液型検査にいってまいりましたー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/minami.hoshino/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/02/10/20111106081922.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さーてなに型でしょー(≧ω≦)??"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うーんなんだろー??Www"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"答えはー(*´д｀*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度のブログで♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お楽しみにー(。・ω・。)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回のブログの文字がめっちゃおおきくて読みにくかった方ごめんねー(T^T)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも通りやったんだけどなー??うーん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まっ!そんなこともあるさ(>ω<＊)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばいにゃーん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/minami.hoshino/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/02/10/2i_3.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-24711":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは\nお久しぶりの更新。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絶賛ツアー中です！！\n仙台、名古屋、広島ときて\nここまで全8公演っ\nちょうど折り返しました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回は、会場のみなさんをそばに感じながらできてるな～と\n今までよりさらに実感しています♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださったみなさま\nありがとうございます(o^^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"仙台で幕開け。\n始まった瞬間から\n去年から溜まってたエネルギーが放出された感じで\n(去年はツアー参加していないので。)\nとにかく楽しいぃぃいという気持ち一筋で駆け抜けました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名古屋。\nあっつかったーーー！！\n気温もだし、日本ガイシホール広かったので\nみなさんの熱気で\nいい汗いっぱいかきましたっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして今日は\n広島で初のライブでした。\n盛り上がりとか一体感とか\n初めてとは思えないほどでほっこり♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また来年も来たいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/erika.ikuta/img/2015/08/16/2351238/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お好み焼き食べ中～\nもうほんまに本場の味、大好きじゃけーーー\nたらたらふくふくいただきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/erika.ikuta/img/2015/08/16/2351238/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"からあげ姉さんが昼公演でデコ出ししてたので\n私も夜マネしてみた。\nすっきりー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/erika.ikuta/img/2015/08/16/2351238/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好きなひめたんの地元。\nホテル相部屋だったのですが、\nあんなにルンルンしてるのはめったに見ない姿でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやもライブのラストで泣きながらお礼を言っていて\n地元愛、素敵だなぁと思いました(;_;)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだあと半分あるので\n福岡、大阪、神宮まで\nただ進むだけじゃなく、上っていけるように\n頑張るぞーーーー！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"エリカ(。・∀・。)☆彡"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-24233":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日、ラジオ沈黙の金曜日で\n初解禁されました12枚目アンダー楽曲\n「別れ際、もっと好きになる」の\nセンターを務めさせて\nいただくことになりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回初めてのアンダーで\nセンターをやらせていただける\nという事で不安もあります。\n7枚目シングルで選抜のセンターを\nさせていただきましたが\nそこから見た景色と今回のポジション\nからみた景色はきっとまた違う。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"プレッシャーもありますが\n沢山学べる事もあるし成長できる\n機会なので私は私らしく、、、\n12枚目の期間も全力で頑張ります。\n自分に負けない！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回は2期生が全員昇格して\n初めてのシングルでもあるので\n何だか嬉しいな...\nアンダーもよろしくお願いします♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miona.hori/img/blog/miona.hori/img/2015/06/26/2456832/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miona.hori/img/blog/miona.hori/img/2015/06/26/2456832/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"切なくてでも明るい\n素敵な曲です！\n是非聞いて下さい♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではでは読んでくださり\nありがとうございました。"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-10899":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは5thシングル\n「君の名は希望」発売日。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私もフラゲして早速入れて\n聴いております。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/13/7594292/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...「まりっか'17」も発売。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回の個人pvは2ndでお世話になった\n福島真希監督、スタッフさん、\n振り付けは菅生なぎささん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2ndの作品がご縁で真希監督と\n音楽担当の福島節さんが\n入籍されたと聞いて、\n...ドキドキ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"改めて、\nご結婚おめでとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりっかは恋のキューピット\nなんだよ！と言ってくださって..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんだか私まで幸せ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"撮影後に、手作りのカードで\nお祝いしました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/13/7594292/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さて、作品ですが...\n高画質で見ると表情がよくわかる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろいろ違反してます。\nいろいろ間違えてます。\n17歳、こんなやんちゃでいいのやら"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/13/7594292/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しかしリボンは上まで止めてます。\nまりっかクオリティ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あのっ、1回目は\n前髪とポニーテールと表情と\n外れた音程とゆる過ぎるダンスに\n注目してください。\n2回目は壁に注目してください。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"歌い終わったらすぐに\nメニューに戻さないでください←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、他のメンバーの個人pvでも\n助っ人出演させていただきました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/13/7594292/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さて、誰の個人pvでしょう？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......\nそして今日の0:00から\n「君の名は希望」に収録されてる\n楽曲の着うたが全曲配信されてます♫\n詳しくは公式サイトを見てください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"公式プロフィールの写真も\n5th仕様になりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真正面で卒業アルバムみたいだった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/13/7594292/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一駅分歩いて漫画買った。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あのね。\n私、女の子は絶対少女漫画を\n読むものかと思ってたんだけど..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読まない子もいるし、\n少年漫画読む子もいる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近になって私はよく漫画を\n読む方なんだなーと思った。\n少女漫画しか読まないけど。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブックオフ行って一日中\n読んだりもするし、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから私の妄想は\nロマンティックなのかあ...←ぇ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......\n朝日新聞×乃木坂46\n「乃木坂と、まなぶ」のサイトが\nオープンしました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/13/7594292/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひ見てください。\n......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/13/7594292/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"校庭でキューピット踊った♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"},"sba-nogi-49753":{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"  \n  こんにちは。\n  \n  今日から乃木坂46メンバーとして7年目を迎えます。\n  ファンの皆様、関係者の皆様、\n  いつもありがとうございます！\n  これからもよろしくお願いいたします。\n  \n  かけがえのない同期のみんな、\n  大好きです！ありがとう。おめでとう。\n  \n  色々と書きたいことはあるのですが、\n  金つぶの放送が迫っているので手短かに。\n  急いで、焦って書いています。笑\n  \n  \n  \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHF9PNPBZD7KGQGDPY7A9JZ4","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHF9PPPZGP5ZCEMZTNB30PAE","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  写真は以前に友達が撮ってくれてたやつ。\n  \n  \n  今週のbayfm金つぶ、テーマは腰痛です。\n  \n  これはもしや、中2から整骨院に足繁く通っている私のための講座かしら？\n  と勘違いしてしまうような、\n  とっても素敵かつ非常にお得な放送内容。\n  \n  アシスタントにまで優しい番組、流石です。\n  いつもありがとうございます。\n  \n  \n  じゃなくて、まあそれもそうなんですが、\n  リスナーさんの中には座り仕事の多い方もたくさんいらっしゃると思うので、\n  皆様の健康維持のために一役買う事ができればと思います。\n  \n  リスナーの皆様、\n  お便りも是非よろしくお願い致します。\n  ぜひお聞きください〜〜！\n  \n  \n  ちなみに今夜の放送では、\n  このラジオの先代アシスタントでもある みさ先輩の、乃木坂メンバーとして最初で最後のソロ曲である「もし君がいなければ」を\n  初オンエアさせていただきます。\n  \n  これが言いたかったんだ、だからもう満足。\n  \n  \n  今日のブログの締めと致しまして。\n  昨日のshowroomでもお話ししていた\n  両親の焼肉会の様子をお届けします。\n  \n  \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHF9PQR53HQKCNJ38J30DK2M","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  れな\n  \n  "}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-13924":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂1の乃木坂ヲタク\nかりんの発音 上り坂↑\n伊藤かりん↑です(っｴ`o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/09/03/0000269/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絢音ちゃん(鈴木絢音)と"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いーーーー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/09/03/0000269/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/09/03/0000269/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木ここの川後Pさんの回"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん見ましたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前編にも後編にも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"隠れカリンがいますよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/09/03/0000269/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前編は蘭世とお喋り中"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/09/03/0000269/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"後編は若月さんとお話し中"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/09/03/0000269/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"探してみてください～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"8/30 乃木坂46 真夏の全国ツアー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"in Zepp Tokyo"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お越し下さった皆様"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/09/03/0000269/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/09/03/0000269/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回もポジションは背の順で..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私はセンター、そしてMCを"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"任せて頂きました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/09/03/0000269/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本番前、ガチガチに緊張してしまい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなに心配かけました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/09/03/0000269/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ごめんね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/09/03/0000269/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもステージに立ってしまえば"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう楽しさしかなくて"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/09/03/0000269/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"安定の湯気も恐らく発していた。←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回ハウス！が初披露でしたが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いかがでしたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サビ終わりの腰を振るところ、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒さんや中田さんの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"思いっきり振る踊り方が"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごく好きで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お二人をイメージしながら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"踊りました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/09/03/0000269/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/09/03/0000269/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"会いたかったかもしれない"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"MC"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハウス！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それぞれ感想お待ちしています"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/09/03/0000269/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"MCに関して桜井さんが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何かあったら相談してね！と"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"言ってくださって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"泣きそうになりました（；＿；）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"桜井さんみたいなMC出来るように"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なりたいなああああ（；＿；）"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/09/03/0000269/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして夜公演のアンコールで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一期生の方々と一緒に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ガールズルール"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"出演させていただきました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/09/03/0000269/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一期生の方々に気遣っていただいて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二期生も盛り上がれました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/09/03/0000269/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/09/03/0000269/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"会場にいらっしゃった方"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アメーバピグを"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ご覧になられていた方"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気付きましたでしょうか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一実さんが長い間"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"横に居てくださったのを！！！！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/09/03/0000269/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/09/03/0000269/0016.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幸せすぎたああああああああ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(写メは個握の時の)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ステージ上でどう動いていいか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"分からずに居たところに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わざわざきて下さって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ステージの端から端まで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一緒に行ってくださいました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/09/03/0000269/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/09/03/0000269/0017.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...代々木第一体育館。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごいですね、本当に。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二期生の私たちも出演できるよう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張るので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"是非みなさん観にきてください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"9/1 個別握手会in京都に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お越し下さった皆様。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/09/03/0000269/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/09/03/0000269/0019.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"関西圏の方とはバイバイ会ぶり"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/09/03/0000269/0020.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しっかりお話するのは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めてでしたね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/09/03/0000269/0021.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ノリノリ方や"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ネタを仕込んできてる方が"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"横浜より多かった気がします"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/09/03/0000269/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"地域のカラーですかね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/09/03/0000269/0022.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遠征してくださった方も"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/09/03/0000269/0023.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中には私のために遠征してくれた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って方もいらっしゃって..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に嬉しいです（；＿；）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました（；＿；）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1部 低めツインテール"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5部 ハーフアップの横でお団子"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この日私は1部と5部っていう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"部数だったので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"空き時間めちゃくちゃあって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ご飯いっぱい食べちゃったり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写メいっぱい撮ったりしてたよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/09/03/0000269/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"物販行きたかった...(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てことで写メ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/09/03/0000269/0024.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/09/03/0000269/0025.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"若月さんんんんん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/09/03/0000269/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ！巻きツインお揃いだ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/09/03/0000269/0026.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/09/03/0000269/0027.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5部一緒だった仲良し"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"りさこおお(矢田里沙子)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/09/03/0000269/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またまた写メが載せきれないゼ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/09/03/0000269/0028.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに一実さんが3.4部かな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毛先巻いたポニーテール"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"してたんですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あれ、私がリクエストしました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/09/03/0000269/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何がいいかなあ？と"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"聞いてくださったので/////"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私、一実さんのその髪型"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めちゃくちゃ好きなんですけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんはどうですか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/09/03/0000269/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問返し"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/09/03/0000269/0029.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenky